>> title: Black Bean Soup
>> category: Soups
>> tags: beans, vegetarian, blender, pantry
>> counters: Taquería, Diner, One Pot, The Bowl Shop
>> aka: sopa de frijoles negros, frijoles negros, Cuban black bean soup
>> pairs-with: corn-tortillas
>> servings: 6
>> time: 50 min
>> step.1: sweat 8 min
>> step.2: toast 1 min
>> step.3: simmer 25 min
>> step.4: blend to a coarse purée
>> step.5: season

Sweat @yellow onion{1%large}, @red bell pepper{1}, and @garlic{4%cloves} in @olive oil{2%Tbs} for ~{8%min}.

Toast @&(~1)aromatics{} for ~{1%min} with @ground cumin{1%Tbs} and @dried oregano{1%tsp}.

Simmer @&(~1)base{} for ~{25%min} with @black beans{3%cans}(15 oz each; drained and rinsed) and @vegetable stock{4%cups}(950 mL).

Blend @&(~1)soup{} to a coarse purée with an #immersion blender{}.

Season @&(~1)soup{} with @lime juice{2%Tbs}, @kosher salt{1%tsp}, and @cilantro{1/4%cup}.
